  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models (config_002, 0.5907 accuracy) outperform singleprofile models. This experiment tests whether upgrading the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a more sophisticated latent space model) further improves accuracy while maintaining the effective multiprofile setting. It isolates the impact of RNA encoder quality, a critical design choice, without changing other factors like aggregation or fusion. This balances exploitation of the promising multiprofile direction with exploration of better encoders."  
